e":45,"typeText":"{M : Type u_1} →\n  {N : Type u_2} →\n    [inst : MulOneClass.{u_1} M] →\n      [inst_1 : MulOneClass.{u_2} N] →\n        {F : Type u_4} →\n          [inst_2 : FunLike.{u_4 + 1, u_1 + 1, u_2 + 1} F M N] →\n            [mc : MonoidHomClass.{u_4, u_1, u_2} F M N] → F → Submonoid.{u_1} M → Submonoid.{u_2} N","unsafe":false,"value":113,"source":{"code":"/-- The image of a submonoid along a monoid homomorphism is a submonoid. -/\n@[to_additive\n  /-- The image of an `AddSubmonoid` along an `AddMonoid` homomorphism is an `AddSubmonoid`. -/]\ndef map (f : F) (S : Submonoid M) :\n    Submonoid N where\n  carrier := f '' S\n  one_mem' := ⟨1, S.one_mem, map_one f⟩\n  mul_mem' := by\n    rintro _ _ ⟨x, hx, rfl⟩ ⟨y, hy, rfl⟩\n    exact ⟨x * y, S.mul_mem hx hy, by rw [map_mul]⟩","start":200,"end":209},"axioms":[]}